@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@adminEmail = admin@vendeu.local
@adminPassword = admin-local-2026
@sellerEmail = seller1@vendeu.local
@sellerPassword = seller-local-2026

# Em um ambiente limpo, o seed usa seller_id=2, product_id=1 e campaign_id=1.
# Atualize os IDs conforme as respostas quando trabalhar com dados existentes.
@sellerId = 2
@productId = 1
@saleProductId = 2
@campaignId = 1
@externalId = manual-sale-1001
@adminToken = paste-admin-token-here
@sellerToken = paste-seller-token-here

### Healthcheck
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Login admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Usuário admin autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ACL admin
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/health
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Listar produtos
GET {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Criar produto
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Produto HTTP",
  "sku": "HTTP-001",
  "points_per_unit": 15
}

### Editar produto
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Produto atualizado",
  "sku": "PROD-A",
  "points_per_unit": 12,
  "active": true
}

### Desativar produto — execute apenas quando quiser alterar o catálogo
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Listar campanhas
GET {{baseUrl}}/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Criar campanha
POST {{baseUrl}}/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Campanha HTTP",
  "budget_total": 500,
  "starts_at": "2026-01-01 00:00:00",
  "ends_at": "2030-12-31 23:59:59",
  "status": "active"
}

### Registrar venda aprovada
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "external_id": "{{externalId}}",
  "campaign_id": {{campaignId}},
  "seller_id": {{sellerId}},
  "product_id": {{saleProductId}},
  "quantity": 2,
  "unit_value": "49.90"
}

### Repetir a mesma venda — deve ser idempotente
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "external_id": "{{externalId}}",
  "campaign_id": {{campaignId}},
  "seller_id": {{sellerId}},
  "product_id": {{saleProductId}},
  "quantity": 2,
  "unit_value": "49.90"
}

### Login seller
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{sellerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{sellerPassword}}"
}

### Wallet do seller autenticado
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### Seller tentando rota admin — deve retornar 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/health
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### Cancelar venda
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales/{{externalId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Repetir cancelamento — deve ser idempotente
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales/{{externalId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Wallet após cancelamento — saldo deve refletir o débito
GET {{baseUrl}}/me/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### Exemplo de venda acima do budget
# Use uma campanha com budget_total pequeno e um produto com pontuação maior.
# A resposta esperada é 422 com error=insufficient_budget.
POST {{baseUrl}}/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "external_id": "budget-overflow-1001",
  "campaign_id": {{campaignId}},
  "seller_id": {{sellerId}},
  "product_id": {{saleProductId}},
  "quantity": 1000000,
  "unit_value": "1.00"
}
